{"id":"eigenartig","lemma":"eigenartig","pos":"adj","rank":2945,"glosses":["peculiar, characteristic","strange, odd"],"ipa":"/ˈaɪ̯ɡn̩ˌʔaːɐ̯tɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ee/De-at-eigenartig.ogg/De-at-eigenartig.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"eigenartiger","superlative":"am eigenartigsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Es ist sehr eigenartig.","en":"It's very odd.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/698463","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Ist das nicht eigenartig?","en":"Isn't that curious?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390621","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Die Menschen sind eigenartig.","en":"Humans are weird.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"human","l":"Mensch"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Ein eigenartiger Mann ging vor meinem Haus auf und ab.","en":"A strange man was walking back and forth in front of my house.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"man, male human being"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"house, building"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[7,10,"up and down"]]},{"text":"Es ist eigenartig, dass er so etwas überhaupt sagt.","en":"It is strange that he should say such a thing.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"he / it"},null,null,{"g":"overall, in general"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"this kind of thing"]]}]}